{"questionId":"u14-s005-v012","unitId":"u14","numericUnitId":14,"topicId":"u14-sequences","skillId":"sequence-nth-term","difficulty":"literacy","type":"mc","visualMode":"text-only","figureId":null,"sourceScope":"TAIWAN_CAP_JUNIOR_MATH_108","contentAuthority":"CHATGPT_HUMAN_AUTHORED_R1","replacementPolicy":"REPLACE_MATCHING_LEGACY_RECORD_ONLY_DURING_FINAL_INTEGRATION","text":"一條測量路線第 n 個標記距起點 n²+2 公尺。第 9 個標記距起點多少公尺？","givenConditions":["距離公式n²+2公尺"],"target":"第9標記距離","choices":["79","81","83","85"],"answerIndex":2,"independentSolution":"位置公式D_n=n²+2，代入9得83公尺。","mainExplanation":"位置公式D_n=n²+2，代入9得83公尺。","steps":["代入標記序號9。","平方後加2。","依此可確定答案為「83」。"],"optionAnalysis":[{"choice":"79","truth":false,"reason":"79是81-2。"},{"choice":"81","truth":false,"reason":"81漏加2。"},{"choice":"83","truth":true,"reason":"9²+2=81+2=83公尺。"},{"choice":"85","truth":false,"reason":"85多加4。"}],"misconceptionTarget":"把第9個標記的序號與距離直接視為同一值。","prerequisiteSkillIds":["geometric-basic"],"prerequisiteCheck":"使用前置技能「等比數列基本」所建立的概念。","estimatedTimeSec":90,"unitCheck":"題目為純數時無外部單位；若含情境，所有量均使用題幹同一單位並已在答案保留。","roundingCheck":"所有計算使用精確整數、分數或有限小數；題目未要求四捨五入。","ambiguityBoundaryAudit":"答案為距起點83公尺，不是第8到第9標記間距。","difficultyReason":"素養：需辨認標記序號是輸入、距離是輸出，且標記並非等距。","literacyContextNecessity":"路線情境不可刪除，因為它要求解讀n²+2為距起點的位置而非第n段長度。","authoringIntent":"由非等距標記通項求位置。","figureDrawingSpecRef":null,"reviewStatus":"independently-reviewed","noTemplateDeclaration":true,"contentSha256":"8f541cc68ed7b52f644d4ec875ad2fc00dad3b8a19578eb43ba461c4dcdf3859"}
